# Kebu Account Model

Full spec: `docs/product/KEBU-UNIFIED-ACCOUNT.md` · `docs/product/KEBU-ACCOUNT-MODEL.md`

## One Kebu identity — not ten product accounts

**Single Supabase Auth user** connects Search, Mail, Builder, Cloud, Analytics, Business, Opportunity OS (APIs), Score, Reach.

**Forbidden:** separate signups per product · duplicate auth · “Kebu Search account” vs “Kebu Builder account.”

## Structure

```
KEBU ACCOUNT → Kebu Profile + Personal Kebu + Business Kebu (Kebu ID workspaces)
```

**Kebu Mail** = communication layer (personal `may@…` + business `hello@…` / `orders@…`). Switch context — not new login.

## Personal Kebu — FREE

Email · Search · Studio basic · profile · saved searches · Cloud starter · activate Builder when ready.

## Business Kebu

**Create a Business** → Kebu ID workspace. Team invites → **business only**, not founder’s personal Kebu.

## Privacy = control center

Connected services + **revocable permissions** (e.g. Search may use business profile). **Not** “Kebu knows everything.” Server-stored consents — never browser-only flags.

## Pricing

Personal FREE · Builder/Shop tiers — `docs/product/KEBU-PRICING.md`.

## Foundation slice priority

Account + Kebu ID + workspace + permissions **before** bolting on products. See `kebu-master-engineering.mdc`.

Personal eligibility ≠ **Kebu ID** — see `kebu-id.mdc`.
